      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96e7a667d75dcc647f7df6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，那孩子想跑的念头十分强烈。\n若放任不管…恐怕还会\n尝试更加危险的事…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29e2991f2b023cd7c5195200a0fd3678aa4bc26fb45f4cc6fce9b1a49346670f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75af77217b4194abc4a7e5c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她大概是希望先保证孩子的安全，\n再逐步建立信任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2c7e7732dab1e5f546d53b816fbf0f1632b082e00326486d7f1f053d809f038",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09162cc33e2e9578f3c14bcd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，我觉得应该先建立关系",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b85a09711ccf64f69de3d4afd2ddc44475a52b06e57cec1291572f75f9351a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5d1919a3e485ebaa9a69184",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我明白她想说什么。不过，\n既然今后要教她如何参赛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "67b72e8f67f39e652d501da5ffcb4d0ba126a2395e63471138480c5373580622",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b69030ab0e1ce04765fac8cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先让她适应某种固定框架\n说到底就是压制。",
      "source_fingerprint": "957431e3a2e3bc8261682460497f7f4f9d345373ad6e93d92fd02162bc294fbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f75856b49b0914ba2e8b92c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，她带我来到的地方是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab7bfefa6857d1ad96da07d0922191f21c80de1996ae063be978145eeea3c0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49edc85e44663fb0111f5edc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果今后还要继续教导她的话",
      "source_fingerprint": "d999d4f95afb8b90f7c1074a47888dc07478e93ee41b778b11ae00fa8031e3ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2c9458b9a77bfdde765711",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这种『说了也没用』的不信任，\n今后恐怕会留下长久而深刻的影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bb5f80f1cf5170e9759fd3948dc5b1bf056e920605f878d959108f40ae799c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1643e81a95c077e238d703e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
