    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c631b39d2bf6fb928d678ef4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，抱歉。\n在速度上我还是不能退让……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d93b616c3621e73dc693b09926a58e85908e841e08dff00903a3101d886cfd0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d94da0270f43d907674839",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她并非顽固不化，\n绷紧的脸上透出一丝犹豫。\n其实。她已经认同了我的看法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a346361dbd34eb6dc40268203bfdeb65b81d3bd78a0b7a1ec82e2b67a2d2cb9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e390d12517870ffefac2a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那，折中方案吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d107fe31a81ca63d71ba97664b0a91d0f6ae9c69a295880c6565cec9bf0118",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f39231f44a8348170badc486",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那，折中方案哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c52e630f50c9ff06f00234b6b8ef2260b7550fab739fde14c43e936d22cb10e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5e280fd50319288b1c16d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便如此，学生的安全\n想必仍是她绝不退让的底线。那么――",
      "source_fingerprint": "87e1f6e537c8ebc9759ccac699b97e1c49924bf2cbcfbb19494bbbeaac23bc6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09f448d1fa31391b2a309997",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
