    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43f1852e1c91c8020127137d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧紧抱住西沙里奥的背脊，迎风而行的\n小女孩……兴奋得不得了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffebaca15801ab768b612513dc9925e5e4e65df3eb567a18fdcfaba7cceef294",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
