    {
      "uid": "zhcn:281d79ee8cc7c15a13a0b04c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，这个简单直接的办法就是，\n『直观展示自己的比赛本领』\n让她产生崇拜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29e12fcadb01cdd365b19b2b5d55e02705ed751178988bc387774a38d9f6766f",
