      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥所指的方向，\n有个年幼的赛马娘无视教练的呼喊\n在草地外随意狂奔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb7c9b267b7e268f4d3c3945d26385d2c5c63bb1d352d47466d565fb9fb7521b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
