      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说来惭愧，那时我才终于意识到\n让您的一生卷入其中\n是件多么重大的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c249de9ac34349dfda682def6cecfd4563d2636e12c85d04d0d6959cd414c09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
